  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Akkilagunta Moshe vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 11 July, 2022 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.4898 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The charge sheet in the above case was filed against the petitioners for the offences punishable under Sections 272, 273 IPC and under Section 59(1) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier order passed by this Court in Criminal Petition No.1432 of 2020 and batch whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several F.I.Rs and charge sheets registered for the similar offences based on identical facts. Therefore, he would pray that the petitioners, who are similarly placed, are also entitled for quash of the charge sheet filed against him.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier order passed by this Court in Criminal Petition No.1432 of 2020 and batch whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several F.I.Rs and charge sheets registered for the similar offences based on identical facts. Therefore, he would pray that the petitioners, who are similarly placed, are also entitled for quash of the charge sheet filed against him.",
